OBSERVATION 1: a negative max-event-minus-lag value is still an effective watermark
REQUEST GET /healthz
RESPONSE status=200 {"service": "streammill", "status": "ok", "version": "0.1.0"}
REQUEST POST /streams {"allowed_lateness_ms": 0, "auto_watermark_lag_ms": 10, "name": "negative-demo", "window_ms": 10}
RESPONSE status=201 {"allowed_lateness_ms": 0, "auto_watermark_lag_ms": 10, "stream": "negative-demo", "window_ms": 10}
REQUEST POST /streams/negative-demo/events {"timestamp_ms": 5, "value": 1}
RESPONSE status=200 {"dropped": false, "finalized": [], "stream": "negative-demo", "watermark_ms": -5}
EXPECTED FORMULA: max_event_timestamp_ms 5 - lag 10 = watermark_ms -5
REQUEST POST /streams/negative-demo/events {"timestamp_ms": -6, "value": 9}
RESPONSE status=200 {"dropped": true, "finalized": [], "stream": "negative-demo", "watermark_ms": -5}
EXPECTED LATENESS: -6 is below watermark -5, so dropped must be true
REQUEST GET /snapshot
RESPONSE status=200 {"format_version": 1, "streams": [{"allowed_lateness_ms": 0, "auto_watermark_lag_ms": 10, "dedup_retention_ms": null, "finalized": [], "max_event_timestamp_ms": 5, "name": "negative-demo", "watermark_ms": -5, "window_ms": 10, "windows": [{"count": 1, "sum": 1, "window_end_ms": 10, "window_start_ms": 0}]}]}
OBSERVATION 2: an accepted event advances the watermark and returns newly finalized windows
REQUEST POST /streams {"allowed_lateness_ms": 100, "auto_watermark_lag_ms": 200, "name": "finalize-demo", "window_ms": 1000}
RESPONSE status=201 {"allowed_lateness_ms": 100, "auto_watermark_lag_ms": 200, "stream": "finalize-demo", "window_ms": 1000}
REQUEST POST /streams/finalize-demo/events {"timestamp_ms": 900, "value": 1}
RESPONSE status=200 {"dropped": false, "finalized": [], "stream": "finalize-demo", "watermark_ms": 700}
REQUEST POST /streams/finalize-demo/events {"timestamp_ms": 1300, "value": 2}
RESPONSE status=200 {"dropped": false, "finalized": [{"count": 1, "stream": "finalize-demo", "sum": 1, "window_end_ms": 1000, "window_start_ms": 0}], "stream": "finalize-demo", "watermark_ms": 1100}
